// 1-13: capacitor lift up, then two-tone lens ledges (blue then green) over a spike pit.
id l1-13
name 1-13 LINE VOLTAGE
tagline charge up, then mind the colour.
bg city
// RULES: what this room is about, how often each mechanic shows up, how hard each portion is (docs/level-design-rules.md)
main lift capacitor
mechanics current:1 lift:1 capacitor:1 blue:3 green:3
new lift
portion 5 capacitor lift ride
portion 5 blue then green ledges over current
hardness 5
