text THE ZONE CHANGES COLOUR AHEAD.\nSO DO THE LEDGES YOU CAN STAND ON.\nBLUE IN THE BLUE. GREEN IN THE GREEN. || THE ZONE CHANGES COLOUR AHEAD.\nLET GO OF {recal}. PRESS IT AGAIN IN THE GREEN.\nTHE LENS TAKES THE COLOUR YOU PRESS IT IN.
text ACROSS ON BLUE, THEN GREEN.\nEACH ZONE BRINGS ITS OWN LEDGES.\nTHE EXIT IS RIGHT THERE. || ACROSS ON BLUE, THEN GREEN.\nONE BUTTON. TWO COLOURS. NO EXCUSES.\nTHE EXIT IS RIGHT THERE.
text RIDE REACHED THE TOP.\nBLUE LEDGES SHOW UP IN THE BLUE ZONE.\nSTEP RIGHT. || RIDE REACHED THE TOP.\nHOLD {recal} IN BLUE TO SEE BLUE LEDGES.\nSTEP RIGHT.
text THE LIFT RUNS ON A CAPACITOR.\nPLUG IT, WAIT, STEP ON, RECALL THE CABLE.\nRIDE UP BEFORE THE POWER RUNS OUT.
zone blue 0 0 24 34
zone green 24 0 26 34
entity {"type":"source","x":13,"y":30,"id":"s1"}
entity {"type":"capacitor","x":15,"y":29,"id":"b1","hold":10}
entity {"type":"lift","x":3,"y":31,"w":4,"toY":9,"inputs":["b1"]}
